the peace he desires.

266
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,648
I've already sent
out some pages. They'll

267
00:19:30,732 --> 00:19:33,360
make sure that your fairies
arrive here before too long.

268
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:35,160
I'll send for your things later.

269
00:19:36,030 --> 00:19:40,278
Oh, thank you very much.
Didn't quite hate it.

270
00:19:40,362 --> 00:19:42,438
You will get two meals a day

271
00:19:42,522 --> 00:19:45,048
and use as much silver
sugar as you like.

272
00:19:45,132 --> 00:19:47,400
We will provide
anything you need.

273
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:50,100
Should you find that you
require assistance,

274
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:52,800
you may simply
pull on this cord.

275
00:19:53,010 --> 00:19:55,110
It rings a bell
in the servants quarters.

276
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,180
That way,
we'll know that we're needed.

277
00:19:57,540 --> 00:19:59,700
What do I do when
I finish the piece?

278
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:02,220
You will pull it then as well.

279
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:04,628
Do you have any more questions?

280
00:20:04,712 --> 00:20:06,710
And what are you doing in here?

281
00:20:07,130 --> 00:20:09,980
I thought that I heard
a familiar voice above me.

282
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:12,518
And why are you in the tower, too?

283
00:20:12,692 --> 00:20:14,978
Shouldn't it be obvious?
The Duke asked

284
00:20:15,062 --> 00:20:17,348
me to so I can work
on the piece. But you.

285
00:20:17,432 --> 00:20:21,410
Can't. So you are acquainted?
I did not realize.

286
00:20:21,650 --> 00:20:24,488
Perhaps your fates
are intertwined in some way.

287
00:20:24,602 --> 00:20:29,310
All I know is you're here because
the Duke has commanded it.

288
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:35,238
I can't believe I'm
competing with you again.

289
00:20:35,322 --> 00:20:38,700
If you'd call the exhibition
a contest, then yes we are.

290
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:43,218
You can't win. You're no match
for my skill. You're a fool.

291
00:20:43,302 --> 00:20:45,198
If you think you can
defeat Master Jonas.

292
00:20:45,312 --> 00:20:49,050
Happy? Right.
We'll crush her. Yes. Of course.

293
00:20:50,220 --> 00:20:52,350
I'll never lose
to the likes of you.

294
00:20:52,530 --> 00:20:57,790
I won't lose either
to you or anyone.

